      "actions": "reaction",
      "category": "defensive",
      "text": "Trigger Ixamè is the target of a ranged attack\n\nRequirements Ixamè is aware of the attack and has a free wing\n\n---\n\nEffect Ixamè rapidly flexes one of her wings and creates a billowing cloud of mist. She is treated as if she were Hidden for the purposes of resolving the triggering attack, so normally the attacker must succeed at a DC 11 Flat check to target her.\n\nIxamè also gains a +4 circumstance bonus to AC against the triggering attack.",
